Hawee-MEP-Graph
===============

Ghi cong / Attribution
----------------------

Du an nay duoc truyen cam hung tu cong trinh nghien cuu:

    "Improving BIM Interoperability for MEP Systems Using Graphs"
    (AssetPulse) - MACAD Thesis, IAAC
    Tac gia: Krisztian Hajdu, Scott Lebow
    https://github.com/sclebow/MACAD-Thesis-MEP-Graph

Pham vi su dung:

1. Y tuong va phuong phap
   - Y tuong bieu dien he thong dien duoi dang do thi co huong (DAG)
   - Phuong phap tinh diem rui ro dua tren cong suat lan truyen va so
     thiet bi ha nguon
   - Phuong phap mo phong tuoi tho con lai (RUL) theo thang, co rang buoc
     ngan sach gio cong va chi phi

2. KHONG sao chep ma nguon
   Toan bo ma nguon trong repo nay duoc viet moi tu dau, dua tren tai lieu
   mo ta cong khai (Readme.md cua repo goc). Ly do: repo goc KHONG co file
   LICENSE o cap repo; giay phep kieu MIT chi xuat hien trong phan header
   cua 24 file, va hai file quan trong nhat (bim_to_graph.py,
   simple_graphml_viewer.py) KHONG co header giay phep nao.

   Do do khong co co so phap ly ro rang de sao chep truc tiep hai file do.
   Cach xu ly: viet lai sach (clean-room implementation) tu dac ta.

3. Khac biet so voi ban goc
   - Thanh dan (busway) la NODE, khong phai canh -> mang duoc tuoi tho,
     chi phi, lich bao tri rieng
   - Bo sung loai: busway, noi mem, thang mang cap
   - Chuan dat ten Hawee: MSB / MDB thay cho switchboard / panel
   - Dinh muc, chi phi theo Viet Nam (VND, 220/380V, 50Hz)
   - Lop truy xuat + MCP server cho Claude (ban goc khong co)
   - Lien ket sang so hieu ban ve va du an trong he NS cua Hawee
